config BR2_PACKAGE_METALANG99
	bool "metalang99"
	help
	  A metaprogramming library for pure C99/C11, powering
	  Hirrolot's Datatype99/Interface99.

	  Header/macro-only build dependency, vendored here purely so
	  its extracted source tree can be handed to a dependent
	  package's CMake FetchContent as an offline override -- it
	  installs nothing to the target itself.

	  https://github.com/Hirrolot/metalang99
